  <title>Exercise</title>
  
  <exercise>
     <p>
      What are the three main parts of a comet?
<ol marker ="a.">
  <li> Nucleus, coma, and tail</li>
  <li>Mantle, crust, and core</li>
  <li>Lithosphere, hydrosphere, and atmosphere</li>
  <li>Ionosphere, thermosphere, and exosphere</li>
</ol> 
    </p>
  </exercise>

<exercise>
