<exercise>
  <p>
    What is the name of the region in our solar system where comets originate?
<ol marker ="a.">
<li> Asteroid belt</li>
<li>Kuiper belt</li>
<li>Oort cloud</li>
<li>Heliopause</li>
</ol> 
 </p>
 <answer>
  <p>
    c.
  </p>
 </answer>
</exercise>


<exercise>
  <p>
